<title>GERMANY: Tietmeyer says Buba watching forex markets closely.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer says Buba watching forex markets closely.</headline>
<dateline>ASCHAU, Germany 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Thursday the Bundesbank was watching foreign exchange market developments closely and that the phase of the dollar's correction against the mark was now over.</p>
<p>&quot;We are now in a phase in which the correction has clearly come to an end,&quot; Tietmeyer told a news conference following a Bundesbank fortnightly council meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
